   "subject": "How to get a song out of your head \ud83c\udfb5",
   "script": "Chewing gum can push a stuck song out of your head. People heard catchy songs, then pressed a key each time a song came back. With gum, it came back less often. Tapping a finger didn't work as well. Your mouth is busy, so your inner voice can't sing along. So if a song won't leave,",
   "hook_text": "Song stuck? Chew gum.",
