   "subject": "Why 20 minutes in nature lowers your stress \ud83c\udf33",
   "script": "Twenty minutes in nature is enough to lower your stress hormone. City people took short nature breaks for eight weeks. No phone, no workout. Their stress hormone fell about twenty percent more per hour than it normally does. The best value came at twenty to thirty minutes. After that, gains slowed. A park counts. So try it:",
   "hook_text": "20 minutes outside. Stress down.",
